  "locations": [
    {
      "id": "unknown",
      "name": "Unknown",
      "description": "Location: Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "path": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
      "type": "area"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 94,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The past is not fixed here,\"",
        "line": 100
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 104,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Welcome, Light-Bearer. You come to reclaim MY Spire. How delightfully... mortal.\"",
        "line": 114
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 109,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"This node,\"",
        "line": 123
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 112,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"You built your towers on our territory. You drew power from wells we guarded. Without asking. Without even acknowledging. And now you dare to tell me the spire is 'destabilizing'?\"",
        "line": 128
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 114,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"It destabilizes because it was never yours to stabilize. The 'corruption' you detect? That is the spire remembering its true nature. Shadow. Void. The quiet that existed before the first arrogant photon.\"",
        "line": 132
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 119,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"It serves WHO CLAIMS IT!\"",
        "line": 139
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 127,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Because I am not your enemy. The cascade failure you fear? I fear it more. If your network inverts, it does not simply destroy your reality. It drags the Umbra Planes with it. Light and shadow, merged without consent. Without order. That annihilates my domain as thoroughly as yours. We are, for this moment, in the same crumbling house.\"",
        "line": 152
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 130,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"I propose an alternative,\"",
        "line": 157
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 135,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"For convenience!\"",
        "line": 164
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 143,
      "actor": "It",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Your words are persuasive, Anchor. Your logic is sound. A partnership could benefit us both.\"",
        "line": 177
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 145,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"The Umbra Planes were not always as you see. Once, we had Light. A gentle, primal radiance that existed before stars. It was stolen from us, taken to the Deep Vaults by those who feared what we might become with both shadow and light at our command.\"",
        "line": 181
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 147,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Retrieve the Shard of First Dawn. Bring it to me. This will prove your intent is not merely to stabilize your network, but to restore balance.\"",
        "line": 185
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 152,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Then I honor our accord. The Spire will be shared. Dual authorization. Light and shadow in harmony.\"",
        "line": 193
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 160,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Because without it, I have no reason to trust you. And without my cooperation...\"",
        "line": 204
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "timestamp": 165,
      "actor": "unknown",
      "action": "speak",
      "data": {
        "text": "\"Three may enter the Deep Vaults,\"",
        "line": 211
      }
    }
  ],
